      "text": " Breakfast at the hotel. At 10:00 am, transfer from hotel to the point Aguacatero where a Pick up 4x4 will take us to Mamey. Lunch in the village (Included). Our first camping day will start with a walk along the river. At the first stop, we will take a bath in a natural pool. From this point, the steepest hill begins, continuing until reaching Cabañas de Adam where we will enjoy the spectacular natural pool and waterfall. There we will spend the night in hammocks. Dinner at the camp (Included). \n\nDuration: 3 hours. \n\nDistance: 7.6 km. \n\nAltitude: 450 m.\n\nRemark: Accommodation in hammocks/beds/marquees with mosquito nets and blankets\n\nOptional: Mules for luggage transport"
    },
